       <p>② [芦芽] 芦苇的嫩芽。</p>\n        <p>③ [河豚] 一种有毒的鱼。</p>\n      </section>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"speech\">我能指出“蒌<br>蒿”是一种植物，<br>因为……</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder water-scene\">[水面、鸭子与花枝图案：底部]</div>\n    <div class=\"page-number\">2</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
